      "id": "EXTERNAL-EVIDENCE-CODEX-HOOKS-001",
      "kind": "external-evidence",
      "content": {
        "title": "OpenAI Codex Hooks",
        "url": "https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/hooks.md",
        "retrievedAt": "2026-07-25T19:36:19+09:00",
        "findings": [
          "Plugin-bundled hooks can load from hooks/hooks.json or a manifest hooks entry and follow hook trust review.",
          "SessionStart matcher values include startup, resume, clear and compact.",
          "Plugin hook commands receive PLUGIN_ROOT and writable PLUGIN_DATA.",
          "Command hooks run with the session cwd and non-managed hooks are skipped until their current definition is trusted."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "EXTERNAL-EVIDENCE-SQLITE-001",
      "kind": "external-evidence",
      "content": {
        "sources": [
          "https://www.sqlite.org/atomiccommit.html",
          "https://www.sqlite.org/wal.html"
        ],
        "findings": [
          "Rollback journal은 interrupted transaction을 hot journal에서 rollback하도록 설계된다.",
          "공식 WAL 문서는 WAL-reset bug가 3.7.0부터 3.51.2까지 영향을 주며 3.51.3과 명시된 backport에서 수정됐다고 기록한다.",
          "현재 repository Python sqlite3 runtime은 SQLite 3.46.1이다."
        ]
      }
    },
